{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu064-e-sr-nieyou-letter","title":"聂友书谏恪宜按兵养锐","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu064-a-fcae1a642b02a0a669a4","label":"正文","text":"丹杨太守聂友素与恪善，书谏：成先帝遏东关之志已有非常之功，宜且按兵养锐观衅而动，今乘势复大出天时未可而苟任盛意，私心以为不安","evidence":["santizhu064-q-9e8934f92344ed0c3b5d"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0114","role":"书谏诸葛恪","evidence":["santizhu064-q-9e8934f92344ed0c3b5d"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0041","role":"受谏者","evidence":["santizhu064-q-9e8934f92344ed0c3b5d"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-9e8934f92344ed0c3b5d"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-9e8934f92344ed0c3b5d","source_order":[64,233,0],"order":10958}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0041","name":"诸葛恪","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0114","name":"聂友","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu064-q-9e8934f92344ed0c3b5d","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-d78592e145dbc33cf518","layer":"original","quote":"丹杨太守聂友素与恪善，书谏恪曰：“大行皇帝本有遏东关之计，计未施行。今公辅赞大业〖1〗，成先帝之志；寇远自送，将士凭赖威德，出身用命〖2〗：一旦有非常之功〖3〗，岂非宗庙神灵社稷之福邪！宜且按兵养锐，观衅而动。今乘此势，欲复大出；天时未可，而苟任盛意：私心以为不安。”","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":232,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
